            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ngon Long Ga",
            "review_text": "LyndalJ\n44 contributions\n0\nGreat lunch place\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nThis is a local restaurant on a corner near Xom Moi market. We had an enormous lunch for a very good price. We ordered a chicken hot pot between the two of us and some green fried rice - the half hot pot would have been enough. It came with a large pile of green leaves, mint, coriander etc, the chicken and sauces. Great value for less than AU15 including drinks\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 9, 2017",
